// TestShadow_TurnEndPushesWhenFlagged tests the full lifecycle:
// 1. Agent starts turn (ACTIVE)
// 2. Agent makes changes and commits
// 3. PrePush would set PushedDuringTurnRemote (we simulate this)
// 4. Agent stops → HandleTurnEnd finalizes + attempts push
