- Run `go build ./cmd/entire/cli/strategy/...` to verify compilation
- Run `go test ./cmd/entire/cli/strategy/ -run "TestHandleTurnEnd_PushesFinalizedCheckpoints|TestHandleTurnEnd_SkipsPushWhenNotFlagged" -v` to verify tests pass
